"""Every claim the five source articles make, paraphrased, one row each.

The articles are paid content kept under bootstrap/git-ignored-articles/ and never
committed. Nothing here is a quotation: each claim is a paraphrase with a section
reference, precise enough that a reader holding the article can find it.

Kinds (the evidence each demands is decided by ClaimEvidence.IsValid in the rulebook):
  Concept             something the system must represent
  Prescription        something the system must do or enforce; needs a firing witness
  CompetencyQuestion  something a role must be able to ask and get answered
  Standard            a standard, ontology or method the system must use
  Scenario            a worked example the article tells its story through
  Illustration        a passing example; covered by witnessing the point it makes

Row shape: (ArticleClaimId, SourceArticleId, ClaimKind, SectionRef, ClaimText)
"""

