    ("pkm4-p21", "pkm-4", P, M4, "Ontology quality is tested by running the competency questions as tasks."),
    ("pkm4-p22", "pkm-4", P, M4, "The ontology must be shown to satisfy its stated requirements, not just to be well formed."),
    ("pkm4-p23", "pkm-4", P, BI4, "Ontology work starts from real use cases."),
